a narrow path for many monsters. Though Elbereth related techniques is just
on aspect; to survive there's also the strategic considerations, whether
or when to do the mines, or strive for Sokoban to get the chance of a wand
to burn the helpful word. But there are so many tactical and strategical
aspects in Nethack that it's really hard for me to pick any single one as
a most significant representative; it's a mix. When inspecting other folks
on NAO I also don't have the impression that I would do anything specific;
